@@@!atrep-exo
@=kolophon=>latex

@@/ LaTeX export of a colophon: one line a field, in stock LaTeX
@@/ (no macro of a document class is assumed, so the block
@@/ compiles under any class a host exo carries). The host exo
@@/ sets the lines.

@%
\ \textbackslash{}
{ \{
} \}
$ \$
& \&
# \#
_ \_
% \%
~ \textasciitilde{}
^ \textasciicircum{}
%@

@-> *paragraph
@(grammata)
>-@

@-> :
@(grammata)\par
>-@
